rrentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const elevationValuesOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; elevationValues: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const elevationValidityOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; elevationValidity: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const settingsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read&gt; settings: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const output0Offset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; output0: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const output1Offset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; output1: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">const WIDTH: u32 = 64u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">const HEIGHT: u32 = 64u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">const WIDTH_SIGNED: i32 = 64;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">const HEIGHT_SIGNED: i32 = 64;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">var&lt;private&gt; windowValid: bool;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">var&lt;private&gt; ringValid: bool;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">fn isFiniteValue(value: f32) -&gt; bool { return (bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(value) &amp; 0x7f800000u) != 0x7f800000u; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">fn getGroundCellSize(row: u32) -&gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">  let cellSize = vec2&lt;f32&gt;(settings[settingsOffset + 0u], settings[settingsOffset + 1u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">  return cellSize;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">// Elevation of an offset sample minus the centre elevation; flags the window invalid on failure.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">fn readWindowDelta(column: u32, row: u32, dx: i32, dy: i32, centre: f32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">  var sampleColumn = i32(column) + dx;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">  var sampleRow = i32(row) + dy;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  sampleColumn = clamp(sampleColumn, 0, WIDTH_SIGNED - 1);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">  sampleRow = clamp(sampleRow, 0, HEIGHT_SIGNED - 1);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  let sampleIndex = u32(sampleRow) * WIDTH + u32(sampleColumn);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">  let value = elevationValues[elevationValuesOffset + sampleIndex];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">  if (elevationValidity[elevationValidityOffset + sampleIndex] == 0u || !isFiniteValue(value)) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">    windowValid = false;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">    return 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">  return value - centre;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">// Ring samples never clamp: any sample outside the raster or invalid invalidates the ring.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">fn readRingDelta(column: u32, row: u32, dx: i32, dy: i32, centre: f32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  let sampleColumn = i32(column) + dx;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">  let sampleRow = i32(row) + dy;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">  if (sampleColumn &lt; 0 || sampleRow &lt; 0 || sampleColumn &gt;= WIDTH_SIGNED || sampleRow &gt;= HEIGHT_SIGNED) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">    ringValid = false;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">    return 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">  let sampleIndex = u32(sampleRow) * WIDTH + u32(sampleColumn);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  let value = elevationValues[elevationValuesOffset + sampleIndex];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">  if (elevationValidity[elevationValidityOffset + sampleIndex] == 0u || !isFiniteValue(value)) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">    ringValid = false;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">    return 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  return value - centre;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"59\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"60\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">  _ = &amp;elevationValues;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">  _ = &amp;elevationValidity;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">  _ = &amp;settings;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">  _ = &amp;output0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">  _ = &amp;output1;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">  let row = index / WIDTH;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">  let column = index - row * WIDTH;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">  let centre = elevationValues[elevationValuesOffset + index];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">  let centreValid = elevationValidity[elevationValidityOffset + index] != 0u &amp;&amp; isFiniteValue(centre);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">  let groundCell = getGroundCellSize(row);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">  let wx = groundCell.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">  let wy = groundCell.y;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">  let zFactor = settings[settingsOffset + 2u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">  let cellsValid = wx &gt; 0.0 &amp;&amp; wy &gt; 0.0 &amp;&amp; isFiniteValue(wx) &amp;&amp; isFiniteValue(wy) &amp;&amp; isFiniteValue(zFactor);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">  let cellMetres = sqrt(wx * wy);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">  let invalidValue = bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(0x7fc00000u | (index &amp; 0u));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">  windowValid = cellsValid;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">  ringValid = cellsValid;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">  let z1 = readWindowDelta(column, row, -1, -1, centre);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">  let z2 = readWindowDelta(column, row, 0, -1, centre);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">  let z3 = readWindowDelta(column, row, 1, -1, centre);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">  let z4 = readWindowDelta(column, row, -1, 0, centre);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">  let z6 = readWindowDelta(column, row, 1, 0, centre);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">  let z7 = readWindowDelta(column, row, -1, 1, centre);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">  let z8 = readWindowDelta(column, row, 0, 1, centre);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">  let z9 = readWindowDelta(column, row, 1, 1, centre);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">  let p = zFactor * (z3 + z6 + z9 - z1 - z4 - z7) / (6.0 * wx);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">  let q = zFactor * (z1 + z2 + z3 - z7 - z8 - z9) / (6.0 * wy);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">  let r = zFactor * (z1 + z3 + z4 + z6 + z7 + z9 - 2.0 * (z2 + z8)) / (3.0 * wx * wx);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">  let t = zFactor * (z1 + z2 + z3 + z7 + z8 + z9 - 2.0 * (z4 + z6)) / (3.0 * wy * wy);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">  let s = zFactor * (z3 + z7 - z1 - z9) / (4.0 * wx * wy);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">  let gradientSquared = p * p + q * q;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">  let weight = 1.0 + gradientSquared;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">  let weightRoot = sqrt(weight);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"107\">  let weightPower = weight * weightRoot;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"108\">  let flatLimit = settings[settingsOffset + 5u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">  let isFlat = gradientSquared &lt;= flatLimit * flatLimit;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">  let safeGradient = select(gradientSquared, 1.0, isFlat);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">  let safeGradientPower = safeGradient * sqrt(safeGradient);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">  let planNumerator = q * q * r - 2.0 * p * q * s + p * p * t;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"113\">  let profileNumerator = p * p * r + 2.0 * p * q * s + q * q * t;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"114\">  let tangential = select(-planNumerator / (safeGradient * weightRoot), 0.0, isFlat);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"115\">  let plan = select(-planNumerator / safeGradientPower, 0.0, isFlat);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"116\">  let profile = select(-profileNumerator / (safeGradient * weightPower), 0.0, isFlat);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"117\">  let meanCurvature = -((1.0 + q * q) * r - 2.0 * p * q * s + (1.0 + p * p) * t) / (2.0 * weightPower);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"118\">  let gaussian = (r * t - s * s) / (weight * weight);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"119\">  let unsphericity = sqrt(max(meanCurvature * meanCurvature - gaussian, 0.0));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"120\">  let minimal = meanCurvature - unsphericity;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"121\">  let maximal = meanCurvature + unsphericity;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"122\">  let differenceCurvature = (profile - tangential) * 0.5;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"123\">  let horizontalExcess = select(tangential - minimal, 0.0, isFlat);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"124\">  let verticalExcess = select(profile - minimal, 0.0, isFlat);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"125\">  let accumulation = tangential * profile;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"126\">  let ringProduct = horizontalExcess * verticalExcess;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"127\">  let rotor = select(((p * p - q * q) * s - p * q * (r - t)) / safeGradientPower, 0.0, isFlat);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"128\">  let laplacian = r + t;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"129\">  windowValid = windowValid &amp;&amp; isFiniteValue(p) &amp;&amp; isFiniteValue(q) &amp;&amp; isFiniteValue(r) &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"130\">    isFiniteValue(s) &amp;&amp; isFiniteValue(t) &amp;&amp; isFiniteValue(gradientSquared);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"131\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"132\">  output0[output0Offset + index] = select(invalidValue, profile, windowValid &amp;&amp; centreValid);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"133\">  output1[output1Offset + index] = select(invalidValue, plan, windowValid &amp;&amp; centreValid);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"134\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>elevationValues<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"terrain-curvature-elevation-values\">terrain-curvature-elevation-values</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>elevationValidity<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"terrain-curvature-elevation-validity\">terrain-curvature-elevation-validity</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>settings<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"curvature-parameters\">curvature-parameters</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>output0<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"curvatureProfile\">curvatureProfile</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>output1<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"curvaturePlan\">curvaturePlan</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUTerrainCurvature/evans-young-uniform-clamp · main · 215d17ae</figcaption></figure></section>",
